build/
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/

### VS Code ###
.vscode/

### Kiro IDE — all Kiro artefacts (specs, steering, settings, hooks) ###
# The entire .kiro directory is excluded — specs, design docs, steering rules,
# task lists, and IDE config are developer tooling, not application source code.
.kiro/

### Environment Variables ###
# .env contains credentials (RabbitMQ, Ollama config) — never commit.
# .env.example is committed as a template for other developers.
.env

### Eclipse / Spring Tool Suite ###
.settings/

### Database Files ###
# SQLite files are runtime data — never commit them.
# In Docker they live in the bidtech-data named volume, not the repo.
*.db

### Markdown Documentation Files ###
# All .md files are stored under .kiro/specs/docs/ and excluded via .kiro/ above.
# This rule catches any .md accidentally placed at the root or elsewhere.
*.md
!HELP.md
